<title>UK: UK budget delayed because of alleged leak.</title>
<headline>UK budget delayed because of alleged leak.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British finance minister Gordon Brown's budget speech will be delayed by up to half an hour from the planned 1430 GMT start time, the Treasury said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the delay was caused by a parliamentary question from a Conservative member about an alleged leak of information about private medical insurance.</p>
</text>
